   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "keeps uniq's '=' on short options, so v1's generator\nwrites 'cut -b=1' and 'cut -d=a' (cut rejects both); lets\n-d and -s appear with -b and -c (cut rejects both)",
   "originalText": "keeps uniq's '=' on short options, so v1's generator\nwrites 'cut -b=1' and 'cut -d=a' (cut rejects both); lets\n-d and -s appear with -b and -c (cut rejects both)",
